 items-center gap-space-sm"><div class="hidden xl:flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-1.5 bg-surface-card rounded-lg"><span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-ink-tertiary">Periode Aktif:</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1 font-body-medium text-body-medium text-ink-primary cursor-pointer hover:text-primary transition-colors"><span class="font-semibold">Oktober 2024</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-ink-secondary">expand_more</span></div></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-space-xs"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-ink-secondary hover:text-ink-primary font-body-sm text-body-sm transition-all shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(33,27,37,0.04)]" type="button"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">file_download</span><span class="">Ekspor CSV</span></button><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-ink-secondary hover:text-ink-primary font-body-sm text-body-sm transition-all shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(33,27,37,0.04)]" type="button"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">cloud_upload</span><span class="">Backup JSON</span></button><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-ink-secondary hover:text-ink-primary font-body-sm text-body-sm transition-all shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(33,27,37,0.04)]" type="button"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">cloud_download</span><span class="">Restore JSON</span></button></div><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-space-md py-2 rounded-lg bg-kpi-burnt-orange text-on-primary hover:bg-primary transition-all font-body-medium text-body-medium shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(233,81,43,0.25)]" type="button"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add_circle</span><span class="font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">+ Tambah / Update Toko</span></button><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-[18px]">person</span></div></div></div></header><main class="w-full pt-20 bg-canvas-bg min-h-screen"><div class="flex flex-col w-full overflow-hidden">
<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<section class="relative px-gutter py-space-xl lg:py-space-2xl max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full">
<!-- Ambient Blur Background Elements -->
<div class="absolute -top-16 right-4 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-container/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-2 w-80 h-80 bg-accent-teal/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-center">
<!-- Left Column: Copy & Value Proposition -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start space-y-space-md">
<!-- Eyebrow Badge -->
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-teal-subtle text-accent-teal shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">verified_user</span>
<span class="font-label-badge text-label-badge uppercase tracking-wide">Platform Rekonsiliasi &amp; Finansial Multi-Store COD Terpercaya</span>
</div>
<!-- Headline -->
<h1 class="font-display-hero text-display-hero text-ink-primary tracking-tight">
          Kelola Profit Riil, <span class="text-kpi-burnt-orange">Mitigasi Retur COD</span>, dan Bagi Deviden Otomatis.
        </h1>
<!-- Subheadline -->
<p class="font-body-default text-body-default text-ink-secondary max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed">
          Solusi tutup buku finansial multi-toko tanpa pusing hitung manual. Lindungi kas bisnis dari defisit retur RTS dengan otomatisasi <span class="font-semibold text-ink-primary">Saver Buffer</span> dan skema deviden terukur <span class="font-semibold text-ink-primary">50:20:30</span>.
        </p>
<!-- CTA Buttons -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs w-full sm:w-auto">
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-space-lg py-3 rounded-lg bg-kpi-burnt-orange text-on-primary font-body-medium text-body-medium hover:bg-primary transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">bolt</span>
<span>Coba Demo Sekarang</span>
</a>
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-space-lg py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-card-elevated text-ink-primary font-body-medium text-body-medium hover:bg-canvas-subtle transition-all shadow-sm" href="#fitur-dan-alur">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">calculate</span>
<span>Jelajahi Fitur &amp; Rumus</span>
</a>
</div>
<!-- Trust Proof -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md pt-space-sm text-ink-secondary">
<div class="flex -space-x-2">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary flex items-center justify-center font-label-badge text-[11px] shadow-sm">AY</div>
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent-teal text-on-secondary flex items-center justify-center font-label-badge text-[11px] shadow-sm">NS</div>
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-kpi-burnt-orange text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-label-badge text-[11px] shadow-sm">MD</div>
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-card text-ink-primary flex items-center justify-center font-label-badge text-[11px] shadow-sm">8+</div>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">
            Dipercaya oleh <span class="font-semibold text-ink-primary">8+ Multi-Store Brand</span> dengan omzet COD <span class="font-semibold text-ink-primary">&gt; Rp 600 Juta/bulan</span>
</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Column: Interactive Bento Preview Mockup -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
<div class="relative bg-surface-card rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-xl space-y-space-md">
<!-- Card Header Indicator -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-status-positive animate-pulse"></span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-ink-tertiary">Live Store Simulation • 4 Toko</span>
</div>
<span class="px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded-full bg-accent-teal-subtle text-accent-teal font-label-badge text-label-badge">Periode Okt 2024</span>
</div>
<!-- Hero Metric Tile inside Mockup -->
<div class="bg-surface-card-elevated rounded-lg p-space-md shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-ink-secondary">Estimasi Laba Bersih Konsolidasi</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-status-positive font-label-badge text-label-badge bg-accent-teal-subtle px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">trending_up</span> 23.8% Margin
              </span>
</div>
<div class="font-num-kpi text-num-kpi text-kpi-burnt-orange mt-1">Rp 148.850.000</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-ink-tertiary mt-0.5">Setelah pemotongan RTS dan dividen tim operasional</div>
<!-- Mini Inline Sparkline -->
<div class="mt-space-sm h-12 w-full flex items-end gap-1.5 pt-2">
<div class="flex-1 bg-accent-teal/20 rounded-t h-[40%] hover:bg-accent-teal transition-all"></div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-accent-teal/25 rounded-t h-[65%] hover:bg-accent-teal transition-all"></div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-accent-teal/35 rounded-t h-[55%] hover:bg-accent-teal transition-all"></div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-accent-teal/50 rounded-t h-[80%] hover:bg-accent-teal transition-all"></div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-kpi-burnt-orange/80 rounded-t h-[95%] hover:bg-kpi-burnt-orange transition-all"></div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-kpi-burnt-orange rounded-t h-[100%]"></div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Two Modular Sub-cards inside Hero Mockup -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm">
<!-- RTS Coverage Buffer -->
<div class="bg-surface-card-elevated rounded-lg p-space-sm shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-ink-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-accent-teal">shield</span>
<span>Saver Buffer RTS</span>
</div>
<div class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1">83.7%</div>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-canvas-bg rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2 overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-accent-teal h-full rounded-full w-[83.7%]"></div>
</div>
<span class="font-body-sm text-[11px] text-ink-tertiary mt-1">Aman dari klaim ekspedisi</span>
</div>
<!-- Dividen Ratio Split -->
<div class="bg-surface-card-elevated rounded-lg p-space-sm shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-ink-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-tertiary">pie_chart</span>
<span>Skema Dividen</span>
</div>
<div class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1">50 : 20 : 30</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-1 mt-2">
<div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-teal flex-[5]" title="Management 50%"></div>
<div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary flex-[2]" title="CS Team 20%"></div>
<div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-kpi-burnt-orange flex-[3]" title="Owner 30%"></div>
</div>
<span class="font-body-sm text-[11px] text-ink-tertiary mt-1">Alokasi otomatis &amp; adil</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Mini Status Footer -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1 text-ink-secondary font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-status-positive">lock</span> Local-First Encrypted
            </span>
<span class="text-ink-tertiary">Formula SOP Keuangan v2.4</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- PROBLEM VS SOLUTION BENTO GRID -->
<section class="w-full bg-canvas-subtle py-space-2xl px-gutter">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-space-xl">
<!-- Section Header -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md">
<div class="space-y-space-xs max-w-xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-sm py-1 rounded bg-kpi-burnt-orange-subtle text-kpi-burnt-orange font-label-badge text-label-badge">
            MENGAPA AYUNDASHOP FINANCE?
          </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-kpi text-headline-kpi text-ink-primary tracking-tight">
            Arsitektur Finansial yang Dibuat Khusus Karakteristik COD Indonesia
          </h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-default text-body-default text-ink-secondary max-w-md">
          Berhenti menebak-nebak apakah omzet COD Anda benar-benar menghasilkan laba bersih atau sekadar perputaran modal semu yang habis dimakan retur barang.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- Bento Grid (4 Cards) -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg">
<!-- Card 1: Tutup Buku Otomatis -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-card rounded-xl p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-kpi-burnt-orange-subtle text-kpi-burnt-orange flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">receipt_long</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-kpi-burnt-orange">Efisiensi Tutup Buku</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1 mb-2">Tutup Buku Otomatis &amp; Cepat</h3>
<p class="font-body-default text-body-default text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Tidak ada lagi spreadsheet berantakan dan selisih mutasi COD antar ekspedisi. Rekonsiliasi omzet mingguan Shopee, TikTok Shop, dan kurir COD selesai dalam hitungan menit tanpa formula manual yang rawan rusak.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-lg pt-space-md bg-canvas-bg rounded-lg p-space-md flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-ink-secondary">Pangkas waktu audit bulanan</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-kpi-burnt-orange font-semibold">−78% Waktu Kerja</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2: Proteksi Risiko Retur RTS -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-card rounded-xl p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-teal-subtle text-accent-teal flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">security</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-accent-teal">Risk Management Engine</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1 mb-2">Proteksi Risiko Retur RTS (Saver COD)</h3>
<p class="font-body-default text-body-default text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Alokasi cadangan likuiditas 30%–50% otomatis untuk mengamankan kas operasional saat retur paket menumpuk di gudang ekspedisi. Uang kas operasional Anda tetap terlindungi tanpa krisis likuiditas mendadak.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-lg pt-space-md bg-canvas-bg rounded-lg p-space-md flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-ink-secondary">Ambang proteksi kas darurat</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-accent-teal font-semibold">Dynamic Auto-Buffer</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3: Skema Dividen Transparan -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-card rounded-xl p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-purple-subtle text-accent-purple flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">balance</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-accent-purple">Alokasi Insentif &amp; Equity</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1 mb-2">Skema Dividen Transparan (50:20:30)</h3>
<p class="font-body-default text-body-default text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Bagi hasil adil dan transparan untuk Management (50%), Tim CS (20%), dan Owner (30%) tanpa perdebatan. Setiap pihak memantau angka riil setelah beban iklan Meta Ads dan logistik diperhitungkan secara akurat.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-lg pt-space-md bg-canvas-bg rounded-lg p-space-md flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-ink-secondary">Transparansi hak tim &amp; investor</span>
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-accent-purple font-semibold">Nol Selisih Persepsi</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 4: Privasi Data Terjamin (Local-First) -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-card rounded-xl p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-canvas-bg text-ink-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">database</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-ink-secondary">Kedaulatan Finansial Penuh</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-ink-primary mt-1 mb-2">Privasi Data Terjamin (Local-First)</h3>
